Assessment instruments. The questions in client/src/questions/ and the scoring
in client/src/scoring/ are original wording informed by published instruments.
The instruments themselves belong to their authors and owners:
  - International Personality Item Pool (IPIP), Big Five
  - Experiences in Close Relationships-Revised (ECR-R), attachment
  - DSM-5 Alternative Model for Personality Disorders and the Level of
    Personality Functioning Scale (LPFS-BF 2.0), personality functioning
  - WHODAS 2.0 (World Health Organization), daily functioning
  - PROMIS Sleep Disturbance, sleep
  - Emotion Regulation Questionnaire (ERQ and ERQ-S), emotion regulation
See docs/beyond-personality-framework.txt for the references the project cites.

